  "{0} 的数据里，最有价值的不只是治疗量。支援活着，队伍就还有下一轮资源；支援倒下，团战往往就开始倾斜。你的稳定本身，就是队伍的一部分安全感。": "Among the data of {0}, the most valuable thing is not just the amount of treatment. If the support is alive, the team will have resources for the next round; if the support is down, the team battle will often begin to tilt. Your stability itself is part of the team's sense of security.",
