  "数据口径": "Statistics",
  "数据奖项、英雄热度与地图热度的归档摘要。": "Archived leaders across player stats, hero picks, and map picks.",
  "数据对照": "Role benchmark",
  "数据截止": "UPDATED",
  "数据截至": "Data as of",
  "数据按实际职责独立累计，并在达到门槛后进入排名。": "Data is accumulated independently based on actual responsibilities and entered into the ranking after reaching the threshold.",
  "数据排行": "Stats",
  "数据排行与电竞经理": "Stats & Fantasy Manager",
  "数据支持其作为能在治疗与进攻施压之间切换的双向支援。Jetpack Cat 与 Mizuki 占主要时间，因此需要从录像确认其伤害是否以冷却资源、终极技能节奏或队友安全为代价。": "The data supports a two-way support who can shift between sustain and offensive pressure. Jetpack Cat and Mizuki dominate the recorded time, so VOD must confirm whether damage comes at any cost to cooldowns, ultimate tempo or teammate safety.",
  "数据支持其承担持续压低对手血线并完成终结的主输出职责。助攻分位偏低不能直接等同于联动不足，需要确认英雄统计归因、队伍击杀结构，以及其伤害是否在正确目标和正确时间发生。": "The data supports a primary damage role built around sustained health pressure and finishing. The low assist percentile is not proof of weak coordination; hero attribution, team kill structure and whether damage lands on the right targets at the right time must be checked.",
  "数据支持其承担高下限的常规首发坦克职责：既能提供前排伤害，也没有明显牺牲协同、生存或减伤。Mauga 占比最高但不足一半，说明当前样本不存在单点英雄依赖。": "The data supports a high-floor starting tank role: frontline damage is produced without an obvious sacrifice in involvement, survival or mitigation. Mauga leads usage but remains below half, so the sample does not show a one-hero dependency.",
  "数据显示": "Data display",
  "数据更像一名可塑性较强、能够覆盖多种前排体系的坦克，而不是依赖单一顶尖指标的明星型画像。其价值在于稳定、英雄覆盖和高压阶段不明显掉档。": "The data describes a mouldable tank who can cover several frontline systems rather than a star profile driven by one extreme metric. The value proposition is stability, hero coverage and limited drop-off in higher-pressure stages.",
  "数据更新于": "Updated",
  "数据最支持其在需要坦克主动制造血线与空间压力，并能在 Mauga、Sigma、D.Va 之间按地图切换的体系中发挥。减伤处于其画像的相对低位，不能脱离英雄职责直接解释为前排能力不足。": "The data best supports systems that ask the tank to create health-bar and space pressure while switching among Mauga, Sigma and D.Va by map. Mitigation is the relative low point, but should not be read as weak tank play outside hero responsibilities.",
  "数据最支持其承担以 Mauga、Sigma 和 Ramattra 主动推进交战节奏的前排职责，尤其在推进与闪点地图制造高伤害和协同参与。其核心问题不是能否打出峰值，而是峰值能否稳定转化为可重复的空间、击杀窗口和资源优势。": "The data best supports a frontline role that drives tempo through Mauga, Sigma and Ramattra, particularly generating damage and involvement on Push and Flashpoint. The central question is not peak output, but whether those peaks repeatedly convert into space, kill windows and resource advantage.",
