  "暴雪世界": "Blizzard World",
  "更像经历强队赛程检验、能够在 Bastion、Cassidy、Sojourn、Freja 与 Shion 之间切换的混合长枪。其价值来自对手校正后的稳定竞争力和英雄覆盖，而不是未经语境处理的赛季总分。": "The profile resembles a hybrid hitscan tested by a strong schedule, switching across Bastion, Cassidy, Sojourn, Freja and Shion. Value comes from context-adjusted competitiveness and coverage rather than the unadjusted season total alone.",
  "更像能够围绕队伍集火、控制与英雄功能完成任务的副输出，而不是需要大量资源维持的纯伤害核心。其多英雄价值成立的前提，是高压阶段仍能保持主动性。": "The data resembles a secondary damage player who completes tasks through focus fire, control and hero function rather than a resource-heavy pure damage core. Multi-hero value depends on retaining initiative under pressure.",
