  "更正本图比分": "Correct the score of this picture",
  "更正说明：": "Correction instructions:",
  "更适合作为体系中的稳定输出基线，而非依赖极端消灭数据的资源核心。护送地图产出突出，能够在 Shion、Venture、Ashe 等不同任务间切换。": "The profile fits a stable damage baseline inside a system rather than a resource-heavy carry dependent on extreme elimination numbers. Escort output stands out, with task flexibility across Shion, Venture and Ashe.",
  "更适合需要枪辅主动制造伤害窗口，同时保留临场转群辅能力的体系。近期治疗上升 11%、负场仅下降 3%支持基本韧性；季后赛下降 13%则要求复核高压阶段是否仍能同时完成伤害与保护责任。": "The fit is strongest in systems asking flex support to create damage windows while retaining an in-series switch to main-support duties. An 11% recent healing rise and only a 3% loss-context drop support baseline resilience; a 13% playoff decline requires checking whether damage and protection duties remain simultaneous under pressure.",
  "更适合需要自由人围绕坦克节奏完成近中距离集火、控制空间和收割残局的体系。冠军征程提供了充分高压样本，但模型已中和己方队伍强度；仍需通过录像判断较低伤害是否来自明确分工，而非输出窗口利用不足。": "The fit is strongest in systems asking flex DPS to follow tank tempo for close-to-mid-range focus fire, space control and cleanup. The championship run supplies substantial high-pressure evidence, while own-team strength is neutralised by the model; VOD must still determine whether lower damage reflects assignment or missed output windows.",
