  "最适合以 Sojourn 为核心、要求输出位安全完成终结的环境。名单价值来自击杀转化和生存，而风险集中在单图稳定性、助攻归因以及离开主英雄后的迁移。": "The strongest fit is a Sojourn-centred environment asking the damage player to finish safely. Selection value comes from conversion and survival; risk is concentrated in map consistency, assist attribution and transfer away from the primary hero.",
  "最适合重视枪辅稳定存活、持续供给治疗并减少单图失常的体系。其价值是可预测的续航下限，而不是进攻上限；若俱乐部需要高伤害枪辅或面对更强赛程，必须验证能否在不破坏稳定性的前提下增加主动影响。": "The strongest fit is a system valuing reliable flex-support survival, sustained healing and minimal map-level failure. The value is a predictable sustain floor rather than offensive ceiling; teams needing high-damage flex support or facing stronger schedules must verify whether proactive impact can rise without losing stability.",
