  "退出长期队伍": "Withdrawal from long-term team",
  "适合作为不需要为单一打法重构体系的均衡输出，能够在 Sojourn、Shion、Bastion 和 Cassidy 之间承担正面火力任务。其优势是高压阶段保持，而不是某一项数据的绝对峰值。": "The profile fits a balanced damage player who does not require the system to be rebuilt around one style, covering frontal firepower through Sojourn, Shion, Bastion and Cassidy. The edge is high-stage retention rather than one extreme metric.",
  "适合作为以 Kiriko 为核心、优先保证队伍资源连续性的枪辅。其价值在高治疗转化和助攻联动，而不是额外伤害；最近五图下降 11%需要区分短期状态与地图/阵容变化。": "The profile fits a Kiriko-centred flex-support assignment prioritising continuous team resources. Value comes from healing conversion and assist linkage rather than extra damage; the 11% last-five decline must be separated into short-term form versus map or composition effects.",
  "适合要求主辅主动参与击杀、在 Jetpack Cat、Lúcio、Mizuki 与 Brigitte 之间按阵容切换的体系。其延伸价值来自高参与和英雄覆盖；治疗下限、单图波动及强对手阶段的资源分配需要重点复核。": "The profile fits systems that ask main support to participate actively in kills and switch among Jetpack Cat, Lúcio, Mizuki and Brigitte by composition. Extended-tier value comes from involvement and coverage; healing floor, map volatility and resource allocation against stronger opposition need close review.",
  "适合要求支援位主动参与输出、同时频繁切换英雄功能的体系。入选依据是显著上限和多英雄覆盖；助攻 P29 与相对较短样本意味着必须通过录像确认团队联动方式。": "The profile fits systems that ask support to contribute proactive damage while switching hero functions frequently. Selection is driven by ceiling and coverage; P29 assists and the shorter sample require direct VOD confirmation of team interaction.",
  "适合需要支援线随地图或搭档切换任务的体系：Mizuki、Jetpack Cat、Lúcio 提供群体节奏，Kiriko、Baptiste 提供枪辅覆盖。最近五图治疗提升 29%是积极信号，但没有季后赛样本，不能把常规阶段稳定性直接外推到最高压力。": "The profile fits a support line that changes assignments by map or partner: Mizuki, Jetpack Cat and Lúcio cover tempo duties, while Kiriko and Baptiste cover flex-support tasks. A 29% last-five healing lift is positive, but no playoff sample means regular-stage stability cannot be projected directly into the highest-pressure context.",
  "适合需要枪辅稳定跟进集火、保护关键资源并减少自身失误的体系。胜负语境下降 6%、季后赛下降 8%均属温和，但推进地图治疗明显低于混合地图，仍需确认不同空间结构下的资源效率。": "The fit is strongest in systems asking flex support to follow focus fire reliably, protect critical resources and minimise self-inflicted errors. A 6% loss-context decline and 8% playoff decline are moderate, but much lower healing on Push than Hybrid still calls for verification of resource efficiency across spatial structures.",
  "适合需要输出位在 Shion、Reaper、Tracer 等不同交战距离间切换，并承担终结任务的体系。其入选依据是高上限与英雄覆盖，而不是当前阶段的稳定低风险。": "The data fits systems that switch a damage player across ranges through Shion, Reaper and Tracer while assigning finishing responsibility. Selection is based on ceiling and coverage, not on a currently low-risk profile.",
  "逆境产出变化": "Adverse-result change",
